        "notes": "Now we can have some fun!\n\nYou pick the clone as you power because the clone will be used to keep you up while you are saving your teammates with the swift step heal and hurling those kunai at the enemies!\n\nFocus on cool-down reductions! Cool down reduction allows you to swift step more frequently, which means more healing for you!!! Which also allows you to do more damage!!\n\nI would recommend \"spreading the love,\" meaning I would not drop all of your cash into one cool-down reduction power; instead, optimize it by spreading it out over multiple powers as I have done here. The more cool-down reductions, the better! This will allow you to continue farming some cash, do increased damage, survive, and pop Swift Step on repeat.",
