        "notes": "Round 4 is a farming round. \n\nSame thing as round 2, reflect on how you and your team played, and build on what you needed. \n\nIn this instance, let's say you were getting one shot, etc., which was preventing your teammates from staying up. You can't heal if you are dead! This build is an example of adding an additional cool-down reduction while also building into survivability so that you can still farm your cash. \n\nIn this round, however, you can pretty much build it into whatever way you need. I would recommend ability power, survivability, and then weapon power. That is in descending order of importance. However, again, reflect on how the previous round went and adjust accordingly!",
