        "created_at": "2025-07-25T07:05:08.101817+00:00",
        "notes": "In the final round, you have a few options for powers: \nKeen Kunai: If you have good aim (unlike myself), this is perfect for this build since it helps reduce cool downs. However, you have the aim of a potato; I would not recommend this power.  \nSelf-care: Again, if you are dying a lot. This might be the way to go. Just keep in mind your max health. \nCleansing charge: Ultimate charge farmer. Unless you are against DVA, then it may or may not farm for you. Choose wisely.\nTwo-zu: Most value is if you pick this in round 5, but this could be good too! Especially paired with the talisman of life.  Same as above, be mindful of this with DVA.\n\nSome potential options  (though not recommended):\nTriple threat: If you are confident that your team is fine while you fling some kunai, go for it, but remember you are an aggressive healer, so focus on being the support your team needs :)\nFleet foot: Good for you to live and survive, but you forgot about your team! Remember, it takes away all of the cool-down reductions you have, so unless you want to rework your whole build in round 7, be mindful!\n\nIn this round, max out your cool downs to optimize you and your teammates' survivability. Be the annoying heal bot! Be the reason your team wins! \nHave fun!",
